{
  "scoring_tier": "result-level_compare",
  "scoring_justification": "The headline quantities (vibrational frequencies, total energies, dipole moments, bond lengths, HOMO-LUMO gaps, absorption wavelengths, Wiberg bond indices) result from full DFT/TDDFT/NBO calculations which cannot be recomputed within the checker sandbox. Scoring compares the agent's computed CSV to the paper-reported values with tolerances and verifies absorption wavelength trends.",
